{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Prerequisites: Constitution 15 or higher\n\nYou\u0027ve traveled long and hard through thick and thin, your journey won\u0027t end here and that spark in your eyes proves it. For having such a resolve you gain the following benefits:\n\n- Increase your Constitution score by 1, to a maximum of 20.\n\n- You have advantage on death saving throws\n\n- After being reduced to half of your hit points for the first time after a long rest, you enter a state of determination. You have the effects of Heroism until your next short or long rest, not requiring concentration, and the spellcasting ability is your Constitution modifier. The hit points given by the spell are tripled.","level":1}],"id":"Custom45715173-c8bc-4a42-9fc2-6e18470fa9f1","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Determined Warrior [SM]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}